#: mainwindow.cpp:351
msgid ""
"<h3>Rules of Game</h3><p>You are the system administrator and your goal is "
"to connect each terminal and each cable to the central server.</p><p>Click "
"the right mouse button to turn the cable in a clockwise direction, and the "
"left mouse button to turn the cable in a counterclockwise direction.</"
"p><p>Start the LAN with as few turns as possible!</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>Speelregeln</h3><p>Du büst de Systeempleger un muttst elkeen Reekner un "
"elkeen Kavel na den Zentraalserver tokoppeln.</p><p>Bruuk den rechten "
"Muusknoop, wenn Du dat Kavel na rechts dreihen wullt, un den linken, wenn Du "
"dat na links dreihen wullt.</p><p>Start dat Nettwark mit as wenig Dreihen as "
"mööglich!</p>"

#: mainwindow.cpp:370
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Number of mouse clicks"
msgid "Moves: %1"
msgstr "Töög: %1"

#: mainwindow.cpp:371
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Time elapsed"
msgid "Time: %1"
msgstr "Tiet: %1"

#: mainwindow.cpp:442
msgid ""
"Note: to win the game all terminals <strong>and all <em>cables</em></strong> "
"need to be connected to the server!"
msgstr ""
"Henwies: Dormit Een dat Speel winnen kann, mööt all Konsolen <strong>un all "
"<em>Kavels</em></strong> na den Server tokoppelt wesen."

#: mainwindow.cpp:445
msgid "The game is not won yet!"
msgstr "Dat Speel is noch nich wunnen!"

#: mainwindow.cpp:483
#, kde-format
msgid "Your score was %1, you did not make it to the high score list."
msgid_plural "Your score was %1, you did not make it to the high score list."
msgstr[0] "Du hest %1 Punkt, man dat hett nich för de Bestenlist langt."
msgstr[1] "Du hest %1 Pünkt, man dat hett nich för de Bestenlist langt."

